# Order Flow - State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROPOSAL_ACCEPTED

    PROPOSAL_ACCEPTED --> PENDING_PAYMENT: Client accepts offer

    PENDING_PAYMENT --> ACTIVE: Payment success\nFunds in ESCROW
    PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAYMENT_FAILED: Payment error
    PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED_UNPAID: Client cancels before paying

    PAYMENT_FAILED --> PENDING_PAYMENT: Retry payment
    PAYMENT_FAILED --> CANCELLED_UNPAID: Client cancels

    ACTIVE --> DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW: Freelancer delivers work
    ACTIVE --> DISPUTE: Dispute opened

    DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW --> COMPLETED: Client approves\nRelease payment
    DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW --> REVISION_REQUESTED: Client asks for changes
    DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW --> DISPUTE: Client opens dispute
    DELIVERED_PENDING_REVIEW --> COMPLETED: Auto complete after X days

    REVISION_REQUESTED --> ACTIVE: Freelancer works on revisions

    DISPUTE --> COMPLETED: Admin decides: pay freelancer
    DISPUTE --> REFUNDED: Admin decides: refund client
    DISPUTE --> RESOLVED_SPLIT: Admin decides: split escrow

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
    RESOLVED_SPLIT --> [*]
    CANCELLED_UNPAID --> [*]
```
